{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-verified crosswalk between the weapon names used by each community data sheet",
    "and a stable canonical id. This file is deliberately explicit rather than fuzzy-matched:",
    "a wrong join looks exactly like a balance change, and silent join errors are unauditable.",
    "",
    "'aliases' maps a NORMALISED source name (uppercase, punctuation collapsed to spaces,",
    "'w/' expanded to 'with') to a canonical id. 'weapons' holds the canonical display name",
    "(8.3.0 spelling where it exists, else the 10.0.0 spelling title-cased) and class.",
    "'ignore' lists sheet artefacts that are section headers, not weapons.",
    "",
    "Judgement calls are recorded in 'notes' and surface in the generated history."
  ],

